      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "contact@mindbloom.tn",
        "toEmail": "={{$json.email}}",
        "subject": "Connexion à MindBloom",
        "html": "=<div style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:#f8f5ff; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"padding:12px 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:796px; margin:0 auto; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e9e5f5; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 16px 38px rgba(111,77,215,0.10);\">\n\n      <div style=\"padding:20px 24px; text-align:center; border-bottom:1px solid #e9e5f5; background:#faf8ff;\">\n        <img\n          src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/mbarkiasma/dream_pfe@main/public/mindbloom-logo.svg\"\n          width=\"210\"\n          height=\"56\"\n          alt=\"MindBloom\"\n          style=\"display:block; margin:0 auto; border:0;\"\n        />\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding:28px 28px 20px; text-align:center;\">\n\n        <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px; color:#1f0a4e; font-size:31px; line-height:1.2; font-weight:400;\">\n          Connexion sécurisée\n        </h1>\n\n        <p style=\"max-width:470px; margin:0 auto; color:#777096; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;\">\n          Vous avez demandé à vous connecter à votre espace MindBloom. Cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessous pour y accéder.\n        </p>\n\n        <div style=\"margin:24px 0 28px;\">\n          <a href=\"{{$json.magicLink}}\" style=\"display:inline-block; min-width:280px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#895ef8,#a987ff); color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; padding:18px 26px; border-radius:8px; font-size:20px; font-weight:400;\">\n            Accéder à mon espace\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:500px; margin:0 auto 26px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-top:1px solid #e9e5f5; width:45%;\"></td>\n            <td style=\"width:10%; text-align:center;\">\n              <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@14.0.2/assets/72x72/1f512.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; border:0;\" />\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-top:1px solid #e9e5f5; width:45%;\"></td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 26px; color:#777096; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;\">\n          Si le bouton ne fonctionne pas,\n          <a href=\"{{$json.magicLink}}\" style=\"color:#895ef8; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none;\">cliquez ici</a>.\n        </p>\n\n        <div style=\"max-width:556px; margin:0 auto; padding:22px 24px; background:#f8f5ff; border:1px solid #e9e5f5; border-radius:7px; text-align:left;\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"width:48px; vertical-align:top;\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@14.0.2/assets/72x72/23f1.png\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block; border:0;\" />\n              </td>\n              <td style=\"vertical-align:top; padding-bottom:22px;\">\n                <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px; color:#1f0a4e; font-size:15px; font-weight:800;\">Ce lien expire dans 10 minutes</p>\n                <p style=\"margin:0; color:#777096; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5;\">Pour des raisons de sécurité, le lien ne peut être utilisé qu'une seule fois.</p>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"width:48px; vertical-align:top;\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@14.0.2/assets/72x72/1f6e1.png\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block; border:0;\" />\n              </td>\n              <td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n                <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px; color:#1f0a4e; font-size:15px; font-weight:800;\">Vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande ?</p>\n                <p style=\"margin:0; color:#777096; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5;\">Ignorez simplement cet email. Votre compte reste sécurisé.</p>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <p style=\"margin:26px 0 16px; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@14.0.2/assets/72x72/2754.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:-4px; margin-right:4px; border:0;\" />\n          Besoin d'aide ?\n          <a href=\"mailto:contact@mindbloom.tn\" style=\"color:#895ef8; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none;\">Contactez notre support</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <div style=\"max-width:604px; margin:0 auto; border-top:1px solid #e9e5f5;\"></div>\n\n        <p style=\"margin:18px 0 0; color:#777096; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5;\">\n          © 2026 MindBloom. Tous droits réservés.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
